# Directory Content Addendum

This addendum is separate from, and does not modify, the Functional Source
License above. It covers the directory's EDITORIAL CONTENT rather than the
Software: the listing copy in `data/apps/*.json` (descriptions, taglines,
"Worth knowing" insights, pros/cons, edge notes, change-history summaries) and
the site's written copy.

That editorial content is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International license (CC BY-NC 4.0):

- Deed: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/
- Legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode

Attribution: "Ignaite (ignaite.app) — Ignaite Labs"

Plain facts carried in the data (app names, vendor names, URLs, pricing tiers,
platform lists, dates) are not copyrightable and are not claimed by this
addendum; it covers the editorial expression only.
